{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11109280","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11109280","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1110928001:0":{"text":"You've got the wrong person. I'd never steal from a diviner.","source_cn":"都说你认错人了。我会蠢到去偷占卜师的东西吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34D7BA0056BDE8CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110928002:0":{"text":"My predictions are never wrong!","source_cn":"不，我的预言不会错！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8497C2D9C83A4247","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1110928002":{"text":"My predictions are never wrong!","source_cn":"不，我的预言不会错！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8497C2D9C83A4247","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1110928003:0":{"text":"Huh? This is it! You found it!","source_cn":"咦？诶？！就是这个！你们竟然真的找回来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2494C4DBF74EC464","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1110928004:0":{"text":"But how is it possible? My predictions are never wrong. I was certain it was this girl...","source_cn":"但是，怎么可能呢？！我的预言不会出错呀，窃贼明明应该是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5B711098CDE7DF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1110928004":{"text":"But how is it possible? My predictions are never wrong. I was certain it was this girl...","source_cn":"但是，怎么可能呢？！我的预言不会出错呀，窃贼明明应该是这个女孩——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5B711098CDE7DF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1110928005:0":{"text":"It was a blonde-haired Mauler who stole your necklace. He hit Chippy with his blowgun before taking off...","source_cn":"真凶是个橙红毛皮的蛮血，他用吹箭筒射中了满满，而且跑得...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C86E8AAEFCC4EC7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1110928006:0":{"text":"Blonde hair, arrows, swift movement... it all checks out.","source_cn":"橙红毛发、箭矢、迅捷的身手，倒是都对上了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F66F5A18ED7A5C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1110928007:0":{"text":"Don't you have anything to say to me? You could tell me where the treasure is as your apology.","source_cn":"你没什么要向我说的吗？比如为了表示愧疚，帮我预测下宝藏...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x02A7033402A29A86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1110928008:0":{"text":"Nope! You had your eyes on my purse earlier!","source_cn":"才不呢！谁叫你刚才打我钱包的主意！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB53BC316605F3CB2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1110928009:0":{"text":"Ahem. I was promised a divination session for the finder of that necklace. It's time to fulfill your promise.","source_cn":"咳嗯。我说，找到项链的报酬是占卜机会，现在是兑现的时候了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x083DAE279803EBEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1110928010:0":{"text":"I got the necklace first.","source_cn":"项链，是我先拿到的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x82D40A8DE2A4185D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1110928011:0":{"text":"I hate to argue with a kid, but the truth is, you would have never gotten the necklace back if not for me.","source_cn":"我不想和小孩一般见识，但事实如此：要是没有我，你们拿不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A36C0CE1E3F8DE3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:20:1110928011":{"text":"I hate to argue with a kid, but the truth is, you would have never gotten the necklace back if not for me.","source_cn":"我不想和小孩一般见识，但事实如此：要是没有我，你们拿不回那条项链。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A36C0CE1E3F8DE3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1110928012:0":{"text":"Hmm... My prophecy didn't mention this part... But everything happens for a reason.","source_cn":"唔……预言里可没提到这个……但巧合不会无缘无故地发生！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4867D22C13944329","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1110928013:0":{"text":"How about... You tell me what you want to know. I'll pick the more urgent one.","source_cn":"不如这样吧，你们先说说想占卜什么。谁的需要更紧急，我就...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA3A54A7362168B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1110928014:0":{"text":"I'm looking for my people. They were taken away by the Quicksand Claws.","source_cn":"我要找族人。他们被流沙之爪绑走了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9EDE255943D6B7A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1110928015:0":{"text":"The... Did you just say the Quicksand Claws?","source_cn":"流沙之爪……你刚才是说，流沙之爪？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDF6C9C6936AF854","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1110928016:0":{"text":"You heard me.","source_cn":"我不想重复第二次。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4589AF2764517C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1110928017:0":{"text":"I guess we're all here for the same reason.","source_cn":"那我们的目的……其实一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52D96A07C77A6AAE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:27:1110928017":{"text":"I guess we're all here for the same reason.","source_cn":"那我们的目的……其实一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52D96A07C77A6AAE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1110928018:1":{"text":"I'm looking for <style=\"highlight\">Ferranc, the leader of the Quicksand Claws</style>.","source_cn":"我有事要找<style=highlight>流沙之爪的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E43FE49D2F04338","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1110928019:1":{"text":"Ah-ha! We just need one ceremony after all to satisfy both of you! You two must have been guided by fate to meet each other here.","source_cn":"啊呀，果然！那就简单了，只需要一次占卜，你们要寻求的就...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51004F37F704799D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1110928020:1":{"text":"I hope not...","source_cn":"……我不想和这个人有什么命运上的纠缠。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x523FD45FF0A70164","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1110928021:1":{"text":"Trust me. You're not the only one.","source_cn":"相信我，这件事上没人比我更同意你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9419F6FDAA81AE06","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:32:1110928021":{"text":"Trust me. You're not the only one.","source_cn":"相信我，这件事上没人比我更同意你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9419F6FDAA81AE06","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1110928022:1":{"text":"I'll need an object of the target. Those who attend the ceremony must be calm and focused. Location-wise, I need somewhere quiet and good for the gathering of energy and fortune.","source_cn":"要进行占卜，首先需要一件来自所寻人身上的东西；举行仪式...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB882F601B370407","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1110928023:1":{"text":"I'll also need three animal bones to resonate with the spirit of the earth. The feet of the earth will reveal the direction of the target.","source_cn":"除此之外，还需要三块兽骨来与土地内的灵气取得共鸣，借大...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2394EB73F37C6532","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1110928024:1":{"text":"I got something of Ferranc's.","source_cn":"弗兰克的东西，我这里有。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB8EB8C3A46C8D3BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1110928025:1":{"text":"I'll go look for animal bones.","source_cn":"我去找兽骨。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5EA43AA14DCC8C63","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1110928026:0":{"text":"Excellent! I'll get ready and wait for you at the <style=\"highlight\">pond in the east of town</style>.","source_cn":"太好了！那你们收集好东西后，去<style=highl...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B2ABA99A75719F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:32:0:1":{"text":"Well, anyways...","source_cn":"（赶快岔开话题）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2421252344BC74F5","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Well, anyways...","female":"Well, anyways...","variant_male_record_index":"63582","variant_female_record_index":"63583","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:32:1:2":{"text":"How do we do this?","source_cn":"那么，占卜仪式……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFA13C351C7324DC4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"How do we do this?","female":"How do we do this?","variant_male_record_index":"63584","variant_female_record_index":"63585","document_title":"","document_title